EXT. HIGH CHANCELLERY PLAZA - DAY

A grand marble amphitheater where eight distinct archetypes assemble for the coronation of the Solar Imperium.

1. THE HERO (Protagonist, Series Regular):
CAPTAIN VALEN (20s, athletic build, golden eagle breastplate, crimson cape, resolute jawline, sapphire eyes).

2. THE SAGE (Mentor, Recurring):
ARCH-SCHOLAR THALIA (70s, flowing silver braids, velvet robes embroidered with star charts, monocle, wise contemplative posture).

3. THE REBEL (Antagonist, Series Regular):
KORIN VEX (30s, lean muscular frame, dark asymmetric trench coat, cybernetic arm with glowing conduits, defiant snarl).

4. THE SHADOW (Villain, Special Guest):
LORD MALAKOR (50s, towering imposing silhouette, obsidian armor trimmed in dark silk, hood casting deep eye shadows).

5. THE TRICKSTER (Supporting, Day Player):
PIP THE WEAVER (20s, agile, patched leather tunic, fingerless gloves, mischievous smirk, juggling bronze lockpicks).

6. THE CAREGIVER (Supporting, Series Regular):
HEALER ROWENA (40s, warm countenance, linen tunic, satchel of glowing herbs, comforting maternal presence).

7. THE SOVEREIGN (Leader, Guest Star):
QUEEN AURELIA (60s, radiant platinum crown, royal purple velvet gown, commanding regal posture).

VALEN
(drawing his sun-blade)
Your Majesty, the perimeter has fallen to Vex's rebels. We must evacuate the throne room!
